<title>POLAND: Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six stocks rose, two fell and nine were flat in Warsaw bourse 13.5-million-zloty continuous trade on Tuesday with the WIG 20 index closing virtually flat at 1,585.7 points.</p>
<p>The remaining five stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units rose 0.3 percent to 148 zlotys in a 5.7-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
